ecei em Madri."],["Host","What did you do last month?","O que fez mês passado?"],["Guest","I gave a talk in Spanish.","Dei uma palestra em espanhol."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Word stress","items":[{"label":"Word stress","note":"Palavras de 2+ sílabas têm uma sílaba forte: eDUcaTION, comPUter, PHOtograph, phoTOgraphy.","words":["education","photograph","photography","develop","different"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Ask How long have you…?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"How long have you lived here?"},{"q":"Answer with since or for.","pt":"Responda.","model":"Since 2020."},{"q":"Add a past detail.","pt":"Acrescente.","model":"I moved here in 2020."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 6 sentences about your own language journey.","model":"I have studied English for three years. I started in 2022. I have practiced every day. Last month I watched a film without subtitles. I have improved a lot. I met a teacher who helped me.","checklist":["Usei **have + for/since**","Usei **Past Simple com data**","6 frases"],"words":"6 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “language podcast” mean?","opts":["prática diária","podcast de idiomas","palestrante convidado"],"ans":1,"why":"**language podcast** = podcast de idiomas."},{"q":"What does “daily practice” mean?","opts":["parceiro de idioma","rotina de estudo","prática diária"],"ans":2,"why":"**daily practice** = prática diária."},{"q":"What does “language partner” mean?","opts":["parceiro de idioma","palestrante convidado","habilidade de fala"],"ans":0,"why":"**language partner** = parceiro de idioma."},{"q":"What does “guest speaker” mean?","opts":["rotina de estudo","palestrante convidado","jornada com o idioma"],"ans":1,"why":"**guest speaker** = palestrante convidado."}]},{"type":"box"